title: The Threat of a Coup
subtitle: The pressure towards a coup grows; PPS learns what could stop it and what would decide the fighting.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && typeof PolishSecurity !== 'undefined' && PolishSecurity.coupWarningDue(Q) !}
